{"mode":"test","title":"","instruction":{"english":"","german":""},"readingText":{"instruction":{"german":"<p>Read the texts. Then go to Exercise.<\/p>","english":""},"content":"<p><custom-image id=\"custom-image_0\"><\/custom-image><\/p><p>Hi! My name\u2019s Maya and I\u2019m from the UK. I live in Bristol with my mum, dad and my two brothers, Kyle and Charlie. My brothers and I are the same age. We\u2019re all 13. Why? Because we\u2019re triplets!<\/p><p>So, my brothers and I have the same birthday, but we\u2019re very different! Kyle is quite shy sometimes and Charlie is very chatty. Kyle and Charlie don\u2019t like sports very much. They love board games and puzzles. I\u2019m very sporty! I play basketball and football. I go to basketball practice on Saturday.<\/p><p>&nbsp;<\/p><p><custom-image id=\"custom-image_1\"><\/custom-image><\/p><p>Hello! I\u2019m Carla and I\u2019m 14. I live in Los Angeles, in the US. I\u2019ve got good friends at school, but my best friends are my cousins. Their names are Olivia and Isabella. They\u2019re clever and they\u2019re fun! Here is a photo of my cousins. They\u2019re tall and they look the same because they\u2019re twins! They\u2019re 15. I see Olivia and Isabella a lot. We aren\u2019t in the same class, but we go to the same school. After school, I sometimes go to their house or they come to my house. On Sunday, we often get together with our family. We\u2019ve got a big family!<\/p>","showOnStart":true,"configs":[{"id":"custom-image_0","type":"custom-image","url":"","name":"reading_1.png","width":400,"margin":{"top":0,"right":0,"bottom":0,"left":0},"float":"none","style":""},{"id":"custom-image_1","type":"custom-image","url":"","name":"reading_2.png","width":380,"margin":{"top":0,"right":0,"bottom":0,"left":0},"float":"none","style":""}]},"sequences":[{"instruction":{"german":"<p><b>Choose CARLA or MAYA.<\/b><\/p>","english":""},"configs":[{"question":"<p>She doesn\u2019t live in the UK.<\/p>","correctAnswer":"<p>CARLA<\/p>","additionalAnswers":[{"answer":"<p>CARLA<\/p>"},{"answer":"<p>MAYA<\/p>"}],"orientation":"vertical","id":"quiz_0","type":"quiz","exerciseUrl":"https:\/\/exercise-editor.helbling.com\/files\/options_1\/options_1_2023_cyber_homework\/unit_04_CH_14\/unit_04_vocabulary_01_ch_14\/"},{"question":"<p>She and her brothers are 13.<\/p>","correctAnswer":"<p>MAYA<\/p>","additionalAnswers":[{"answer":"<p>CARLA<\/p>"},{"answer":"<p>MAYA<\/p>"}],"orientation":"vertical","id":"quiz_1","type":"quiz","exerciseUrl":"https:\/\/exercise-editor.helbling.com\/files\/options_1\/options_1_2023_cyber_homework\/unit_04_CH_14\/unit_04_vocabulary_01_ch_14\/"},{"question":"<p>Her cousins are 15.<\/p>","correctAnswer":"<p>CARLA<\/p>","additionalAnswers":[{"answer":"<p>CARLA<\/p>"},{"answer":"<p>MAYA<\/p>"}],"orientation":"vertical","id":"quiz_2","type":"quiz","exerciseUrl":"https:\/\/exercise-editor.helbling.com\/files\/options_1\/options_1_2023_cyber_homework\/unit_04_CH_14\/unit_04_vocabulary_01_ch_14\/"},{"question":"<p>Sometimes she goes to her cousins\u2019 house after school.<\/p>","correctAnswer":"<p>CARLA<\/p>","additionalAnswers":[{"answer":"<p>CARLA<\/p>"},{"answer":"<p>MAYA<\/p>"}],"orientation":"vertical","id":"quiz_3","type":"quiz","exerciseUrl":"https:\/\/exercise-editor.helbling.com\/files\/options_1\/options_1_2023_cyber_homework\/unit_04_CH_14\/unit_04_vocabulary_01_ch_14\/"},{"question":"<p>One of her brothers doesn\u2019t talk much to new people.<\/p>","correctAnswer":"<p>MAYA<\/p>","additionalAnswers":[{"answer":"<p>CARLA<\/p>"},{"answer":"<p>MAYA<\/p>"}],"orientation":"vertical","id":"quiz_4","type":"quiz","exerciseUrl":"https:\/\/exercise-editor.helbling.com\/files\/options_1\/options_1_2023_cyber_homework\/unit_04_CH_14\/unit_04_vocabulary_01_ch_14\/"},{"question":"<p>She plays a sport at the weekend.<\/p>","correctAnswer":"<p>MAYA<\/p>","additionalAnswers":[{"answer":"<p>CARLA<\/p>"},{"answer":"<p>MAYA<\/p>"}],"orientation":"vertical","id":"quiz_5","type":"quiz","exerc